DESCRIPTION:New in your area\nhttps://ma.to/event/herak-bulatkin-elysium-2
 0-nov-2026\n\nHerak/Bulatkin 'Elysium' performs at Black Cat\, featuring 
 saxophone visionary David Binney. The ensemble includes Miro Herak (vibra
 phone)\, Daniel Bulatkin (piano/keys/samples)\, Mikailo Kasha (bass)\, an
 d Miles Turk (drums). This performance is part of a residency run\, featu
 ring cinematic European jazz\, Balkan rhythm\, electronics\, and vivid im
 provisation. Tickets available via blackcatsf.com.
